{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>For</b> — HaShem said to Abraham, \"and be a blessing,\" and the psalmist says: \"blessings forever\" — for eternity, he and his seed." "<b>You make him glad</b> — from the root of חדוה (joy)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {0 "The embedded quotation \"and be a blessing\" (והיה ברכה) is from Genesis 12:2."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:02.469717642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}